<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LASLANDES JOINING BORDEAUX.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LASLANDES JOINING BORDEAUX.</headline>
<dateline>BORDEAUX, France 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French international striker Lilian Laslandes is leaving Auxerre to join Bordeaux on a four-year contract, the French first division club said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bordeaux-born Laslandes signed for Auxerre in 1992.</p>
<p>Laslandes becomes the seventh new recruit at Bordeaux for next season after central defender Nisa Saveljic of Yugoslavia, Dutch goalkeeper Stanley Menzo and young French players David Jemmali, Romain Ferrie, Ulrich Rame, and Louis Gomis.</p>
